{"id":"01_5583","type":"item","name":{"ja":"EXPO2025 1/144 RX-78F00/E ガンダム (EX-001 グラスフェザー装備)","en":"EXPO2025 1/144 RX-78F00/E Gundam (EX-001 glass feather equipped)"},"description":[{"ja":"（2024/12/13記載）商品名を変更させていただきました。","en":"(Posted on 12/13/2024) The product name has been changed."},{"ja":"大阪・関西万博「GUNDAM NEXT FUTURE PAVILION」にて上映の完全新規映像に登場する「RX-78F00/E ガンダム」を1/144スケールで商品化！","en":"The \"RX-78F00/E Gundam \" that appears in the completely new video shown at the Osaka/Kansai Expo \" GUNDAM NEXT FUTURE PAVILION\" is commercialized in 1/144 Scale!"},{"ja":"• グラスフェザー装備のソーラーパネル部分にはクリアパーツを採用。","en":"• Clear parts are used for the solar panel part equipped with glass feathers."},{"ja":"• ソーラーパネル部分を閉じた状態も再現可能。","en":"• It is also possible to reproduce the state in which the solar panel part is closed."},{"ja":"• バックパックのアームは多関節で可動。","en":"• The arms of the backpack are multi-jointed and movable."},{"ja":"• 新規装備の「ビーム溶接ガン」は差し替えで展開状態と収納状態を再現。収納状態で腕に携帯ができる。","en":"• The newly equipped \"beam welding gun\" can be replaced to reproduce the unfolded and stored states. You can carry it on your arm when it is stored."},{"ja":"• 大阪・関西万博「GUNDAM NEXT FUTURE PAVILION」のガンダム像の装備も再現。","en":"• The equipment of the Gundam statue at the Osaka/Kansai Expo \"GUNDAM NEXT FUTURE PAVILION\" is also reproduced."},{"ja":"• ランドセルは立像版と通常版から選択可能。","en":"• You can choose between a statue version and a regular version of the school bag."},{"ja":"• アーマーパーツの着脱・差し替えが可能。","en":"• Armor parts can be removed and replaced."},{"ja":"• 多色成形技術「イロプラ」で、機体色を再現。塗装をしなくてもカラフルな仕上がりに。","en":"• The aircraft color is reproduced using the multi-color molding technology \"Iropla\". Creates a colorful finish without painting."},{"ja":"• 「スナップフィット」方式で組み立てに接着剤は不要。","en":"• \"Snap-fit\" assembly requires no adhesive."},{"ja":"• シールド、ビーム・ライフルなどお馴染みの装備や豊富なハンドパーツが付属。","en":"• Familiar equipment such as a seal, beam rifle, and a variety of hand parts are included."}],"accessories":[{"ja":"グラスフェザー装備×1式","en":"Glass feather equipment x 1 set"},{"ja":"アーマーパーツ×1式","en":"Armor parts x 1 set"},{"ja":"立像再現用 肩差し替えパーツ×1式","en":"Shoulder replacement parts for statue reproduction x 1 set"},{"ja":"ビーム溶接ガン×1式","en":"Beam welding gun x 1 set"},{"ja":"ビーム・ライフル×1","en":"Beam rifle x1"},{"ja":"シールド×1","en":"Seal × 1"},{"ja":"ビーム・サーベルグリップ×2","en":"Beam saber grip x2"},{"ja":"ハンドパーツ×1式","en":"Hand parts x 1 set"},{"ja":"ジョイントパーツ×1式","en":"Joint parts x 1 set"},{"ja":"マーキングシール×1","en":"MarkingSeal×1"},{"ja":"シール×1","en":"Seal×1"}],"contents":[],"images":["https://d3bk8pkqsprcvh.cloudfront.net/hobby/jp/product/2025/04/dDkt0kqFGsOQ2G6C/xFNpMZiFzsgDTPV5.jpeg?Expires=1765044072&Key-Pair-Id=K7AVJM1114TH7&Signature=VIhoFLZdz1WK~pX6P2IirAn3BHK6bDOCN34g~YVRu~HMwPAqhXKCy8QdXxMdW8P4kHeVHLLAU2mcscwJPXxwbxGd7UdR6nX7lQ68fCzjbydiicOBv3S1ZdJYpCO1SwAvkS6VQuIG0cEu76ndrRaq-IMeJUgkyT4jlDZvAci3bDwf3b9uRCClO8BlJ~g8ytBJIYy63UjpOZGC-mlDcZf25IlFb~4RBvIoRMZkxvgXjeWP7xFNCPIQkNZhuuwn9FuKg8fTzI5kxcs95OhS8APAOxK-kPfmaVacrxdNC3B7RjpR~93WdUi5EOxf2huX4GdJf-h7LlENnemGbJhS~lHRZA__","https://d3bk8pkqsprcvh.cloudfront.net/hobby/jp/product/2025/04/JubEAJqmkoV1aW2W/4Fc8OGBcJ8rEgsOP.jpeg?Expires=1765044072&Key-Pair-Id=K7AVJM1114TH7&Signature=m6ZTzmOCLmnYtRTm9Bsu6HKUc0m~3dr9~HTZtgEfHg905fjCVb2VOQIVDO0YfUCOssEZ6VPcsKOt4q60A~4YjphV1g1OA7I5rkorDGBfiU2g-v8vlwqsCXjN-AuaR6zMrU49srpDkoQA0BPMuRfujEduGtsaedKKuTj3fS~3zC2nJasPaD-lzFJ7murgPqOg6qjjOPCLa~r8Ynv-pmkpkk1n3pUByITmu~fiNBUB~9cYAkoFvoTGtMcbxnvCCqwRI1FPClGy8CtvtPFGqUWCLfDds8Fb2DHIErTQYsipGPd~o0uRVXQOeD7YK7khCqPGmqQb0hdgvgS39Mi~NWy-QA__","https://d3bk8pkqsprcvh.cloudfront.net/hobby/jp/product/2025/04/5pjBNHfOgoQJuUQj/D20pjoSdjfxWLpxA.jpeg?Expires=1765044072&Key-Pair-Id=K7AVJM1114TH7&Signature=YB4Bzi7zC-HrEj2B8C1ln9m9CQInKNb~dBHe0leixhY9OAUx0HVNW3j8-6g8QsLD9DOX5frF-F-AWHczh6xPRV6r-Gwkh25~kaNoOpUa8-3XT-V40~HU7~rpKDtTZJdczKRa4dhfEwry6Ck9EXYSq3B2Lc0miAP3IRkTP7yMrKTTXcN61GRPqKJ-p5CsrastDZxKlsV1GQC1voU-eS6T0ehH2SM2fJlFxblDAqJ-QDBamJxeEYIV2jZahVk9kWXz0FhZwipfdbMKnOScavQHRSmhaQdafuwdEGMIHMoxIFKVCOORM6MzzeCg3TCSyOqN